{"id":"2024260508","kind":"answer","title":"K12 校外教育培训遇冷的情况下，那些在此行业的教师该何去何从呢？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2021-07-28","updated":"2021-07-28","votes":18,"comment_count":8,"minutes":1,"chars":633,"keywords":["间隔重复","检索练习","知识传递","元认知","认知模型"],"summary":"老师们，来制作 Anki 牌组吧！ 叶峻峣：「公告」Anki 高考牌组解密工作圆满完成 Anki 是一款开源的学习软件，通过制作、导入牌组，学生可以在 Anki 的安排下进行每日的学习，努力回答卡片上的问题，做出反馈，以便 Anki 使用间隔重复 [1] 算法来安排下次学习的时间。 教科书作为一种广泛使用的知识载体，有着本质上…","question_detail_html":"<p>　　7 月 24 日，《关于进一步减轻义务教育阶段学生作业负担和校外培训负担的意见》(以下简称《意见》)公布。《意见》明确提出“双减”工作目标：学生过重作业负担和校外培训负担、家庭教育支出和家长相应精力负担1年内有效减轻、3年内成效显著，人民群众教育满意度明显提升。</p><p>　　对于《意见》，教培企业纷纷表示坚决拥护、严格执行，学科类机构部署向科学、体育等素质教育转型。教育专家指出，教师需更新观念合理有效布置作业，学校须努力适应新要求提升管理水平，教育部门应引导需求完善配套政策。而作为“双减”工作全国试点城市之一，广州已经有所行动。</p><a class=\"wrap external\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-1f97956ebbfdf71691bb0a0177331345_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"113\" data-image-width=\"394\" href=\"http://www.jwview.com/jingwei/html/07-26/416059.shtml\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“双减”政策靴子落地 学校、教育培训机构该如何落实要求？</a><p></p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/474516351/answer/2024260508","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"O-tX2Wuw\">老师们，来制作 Anki 牌组吧！</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-0207cab755bfca0b29d1be8eed710191_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"621\" data-image-width=\"1888\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/269808977\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：「公告」Anki 高考牌组解密工作圆满完成</a><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-0c66949dc1f71b3ed968e3f5c8603c50_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-03ce747ad8b5c718463df064e3d8d62b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-03ce747ad8b5c718463df064e3d8d62b_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1440\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-0c66949dc1f71b3ed968e3f5c8603c50_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-03ce747ad8b5c718463df064e3d8d62b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-03ce747ad8b5c718463df064e3d8d62b_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1440\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-8d8eb22b4dca4b020b3b8762491f445b_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-2ef6993850462350bac9e318e0816811\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-2ef6993850462350bac9e318e0816811_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"936\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-8d8eb22b4dca4b020b3b8762491f445b_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-2ef6993850462350bac9e318e0816811\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-2ef6993850462350bac9e318e0816811_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"936\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"P-pZYHux\">Anki 是一款开源的学习软件，通过制作、导入牌组，学生可以在 Anki 的安排下进行每日的学习，努力回答卡片上的问题，做出反馈，以便 Anki 使用间隔重复<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>算法来安排下次学习的时间。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d63f400f9dff7ac452e7007f1c642e5f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-37a86131af549e6afc8a8bd39c6abd90\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-37a86131af549e6afc8a8bd39c6abd90_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"749\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d63f400f9dff7ac452e7007f1c642e5f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-37a86131af549e6afc8a8bd39c6abd90\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-37a86131af549e6afc8a8bd39c6abd90_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"749\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-2415b35d530f7aa2c353a4715d3485c1_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-a7a6856483d859e4cb13ead0fc0870bd\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-a7a6856483d859e4cb13ead0fc0870bd_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"660\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-2415b35d530f7aa2c353a4715d3485c1_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-a7a6856483d859e4cb13ead0fc0870bd\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a7a6856483d859e4cb13ead0fc0870bd_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"660\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"UdO0xh0O\">教科书作为一种广泛使用的知识载体，有着本质上的缺陷——它缺少对学生如何实际学习事物的明确理论，将大量元认知的负担交给学生：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-1eebdcea711e5baa694bac7feaad0878_ipico.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1024\" data-image-width=\"1024\" data-tm-id=\"390507468\" href=\"#/post/390507468\">叶峻峣：为什么书本不起作用？</a><p data-pid=\"DLWku4bl\">而将卡片记忆系统加入课后的复习，可以让学生不再疲于记忆，可以将时间花在最重要的理解上。我认为 Osmosis 是将教学和卡片结合的最好的平台之一：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-883a2a00c76f77bf0d7bc6a59cf49f10_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"523\" data-image-width=\"1642\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/106058169\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：【介绍】Osmosis——视频网课、卡片与间隔重复的有机结合</a><p data-pid=\"2wSo2HXw\">这里还有一位教师的七年实践报告：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-9d8cbbc4bd7ebe8174495fba45f0ca71_ipico.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1274\" data-image-width=\"1280\" data-tm-id=\"382699591\" href=\"#/post/382699591\">叶峻峣：在课堂上使用间隔重复软件的这七年</a><p data-pid=\"Tgr_xV8r\">可能会有老师问，做这些卡片有什么收益吗？</p><p data-pid=\"r30Adk5p\">我认为至少会有以下收益：</p><ol><li data-pid=\"7Zq0nYUR\">学生的学习效率提高，会更喜欢您的课程</li><li data-pid=\"elCFKnJf\">制作的卡片可以复用，更方便地积累您的教学材料</li><li data-pid=\"I_NJQ4fb\">高质量的牌组可以发布出版，获得持续收益（当然，这需要相关平台更加成熟）</li><li data-pid=\"BvpFrC4W\">通过收集卡片学习记录，可以对学生的情况进行更详细的分析</li></ol><p data-pid=\"fP0YFzml\">我相信，基于间隔重复算法的抽认卡系统是未来教育的基础设施，而卡片的内容则是在这之上的摩天大楼的砖瓦。我们需要更多高质量的卡片，来帮助学生掌握知识，逐渐理解。</p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 【理论】Study smarter, NOT longer. 你需要间隔重复！ <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"57020308\" href=\"#/post/57020308\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"390507468","title":"为什么书本不起作用？","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":170,"minutes":22,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"57020308","title":"【理论】Study smarter, NOT longer. 你需要间隔重复！","author":"Osmosis from Elsevier","votes":135,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"382699591","title":"在课堂上使用间隔重复软件的这七年","author":"tanagrabeast","votes":35,"minutes":166,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"1917184516780430695","title":"【重译】为什么书籍不起作用","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":256,"minutes":22,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"676124111","title":"论学习的广度与深度","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":266,"minutes":14,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"1979846755966276606","title":"学会如何学习","author":"Neel Nanda","votes":521,"minutes":17,"reason":"延伸深读 · Neel Nanda"},{"id":"643871124","title":"Andy Matuschak - 自学，间隔重复，以及为什么书本不起作用","author":"Dwarkesh Patel","votes":289,"minutes":95,"reason":"延伸深读 · Dwarkesh Patel"},{"id":"394795804","title":"我们如何才能开发出变革性的思想工具？","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":219,"minutes":89,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"1979258386110514980","title":"我读过很多书，但后来大部分都被我忘记了，那阅读的意义是什么？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":436,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 436 赞同"},{"id":"3499412281","title":"通过互联网可以更高效地获取信息和学习知识，我们还必须要读书吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":117,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 117 赞同"},{"id":"1934586432271393769","title":"有人提出“读书无用论”你怎么看待这个问题？读书真的无用吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":206,"minutes":24,"reason":"相似问答 · 206 赞同"},{"id":"2516762593","title":"很用心看一本书，但看完就忘记了，是记忆力的问题吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":65,"minutes":22,"reason":"相似问答 · 65 赞同"},{"id":"2799122491","title":"看书过目就忘是不是脑子不好？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":258,"minutes":25,"reason":"相似问答 · 258 赞同"}]}